  "usability_domain": [
    "Reproduce the GSE194040 pretreatment gene-expression workflow and its exploratory pooled binary classifier for pathological complete response (pCR).",
    "Verify the frozen internal train/test evaluation and run validated single-patient research inference with the saved scikit-learn pipeline.",
    "The historical processed dataset was produced under the preprocessing environment recorded in logs/gse194040_session_info.json (CPython 3.12.13, pandas 3.0.1, NumPy 2.3.5); it is intentionally excluded from the submission and can be recreated with the included download and preprocessing script. The current dependency lock (pandas 2.2.2, NumPy 2.5.1) is intended for prediction, validation, testing, and future versioned runs and did not produce the historical dataset.",
    "Source-data attribution: NCBI Gene Expression Omnibus accession GSE194040, titled 'I-SPY2-990 mRNA/RPPA Data Resource: mRNA component'; the GEO record lists Denise Wolf, Christina Yau, and Laura van 't Veer as series contributors and PubMed identifiers 35623341 and 40905691. The downloaded GEO archives are intentionally excluded. Original source data remain governed by NCBI GEO and the original data submitters' terms.",
    "Licence scopes are separate: PredictMod repository source code is MIT licensed; the submitted trained model is CC BY 4.0 under the PredictMod User Guide; this BCO is CC BY 4.0; and PredictMod database sets are CC BY 4.0 under the HIVE PredictMod website. None of those PredictMod licences is asserted to cover the original GSE194040 source data or the vendored IEEE 2791 schema snapshot.",
    "The workflow is not a treatment-selection model, does not estimate treatment effects, and does not produce calibrated clinical probabilities or individualized clinical risk."
  ],
